This directory contains maintainer scripts for working on Companion. They
are never distributed (see ../../buildfile).

glibc-symbols

  Generate the glibc symbol version bindings for a glibc floor and an
  architecture (libcompanion/libcompanion/glibc-<cpu>.hxx). Regenerate
  them when the floor changes.

steam-restart

  Restart the Linux Steam client with Companion module loaded, which is
  what trying a build of the module takes: the module is only loaded when
  the client starts. Optionally install from the build configurations first,
  then shut the client down, start it with the companion program, and
  wait for Companion to settle. For example:

  libcompanion/etc/private/steam-restart --install ../companion-gcc32 \
                                         --install ../companion-gcc

Note that both scripts are for Linux. See the comments at the beginning of
each for the details.
